

All the image files are in the public folder. You can access them by using /filename.extension
Use concepts of the box model when designing the frontend.
Code inside the section elements.


**IMPORTANT**
Always code in a separate branch, call it local_development_yourname
create it by typing this in your terminal:
    git checkout -b local_development_thabo

also you can switch between branches by using:
    git checkout branchname

after you're done making changing, push them to the repo by using:
    git add .
    git commit -m "What changes you made"
    git push -u origin local_development_thabo